{"suttaId":"sn35.236","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[1144,1145],"vripara":"236"},"segments":{"sn35.236:0.3":"Paṭhamahatthapādopamasuttaṃ","sn35.236:1.1":"“Hatthesu, bhikkhave, sati ādānanikkhepanaṃ paññāyati;","sn35.236:1.2":"pādesu sati abhikkamapaṭikkamo paññāyati;","sn35.236:1.3":"pabbesu sati samiñjanapasāraṇaṃ paññāyati;","sn35.236:1.4":"kucchismiṃ sati jighacchā pipāsā paññāyati.","sn35.236:1.5":"Evameva kho, bhikkhave, cakkhusmiṃ sati cakkhusamphassapaccayā uppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe … jivhāya sati jivhāsamphassapaccayā uppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe … manasmiṃ sati manosamphassapaccayā uppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe ….","sn35.236:2.1":"“Hatthesu, bhikkhave, asati ādānanikkhepanaṃ na paññāyati;","sn35.236:2.2":"pādesu asati abhikkamapaṭikkamo na paññāyati;","sn35.236:2.3":"pabbesu asati samiñjanapasāraṇaṃ na paññāyati;","sn35.236:2.4":"kucchismiṃ asati jighacchā pipāsā na paññāyati.","sn35.236:2.5":"Evameva kho, bhikkhave, cakkhusmiṃ asati cakkhusamphassapaccayā nuppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe … jivhāya asati jivhāsamphassapaccayā nuppajjati … pe … manasmiṃ asati manosamphassapaccayā nuppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhan”ti.","sn35.236:2.8":"Navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":308,"to":308,"paras":[{"para":308,"vripara":"236-237","refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["236-237. Navame <b>hatthesu, bhikkhave, satī</b>ti hatthesu vijjamānesu.","Dasame <b>na hotī</b>ti vuccamāne bujjhanakānaṃ ajjhāsayavasena vuttaṃ.","Dvīsupi cetesu vipākasukhadukkhameva dassetvā vaṭṭavivaṭṭaṃ kathitanti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"],["sn35.236:1"],["sn35.236:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn35.236:1.1","hatthesu bhikkhave satī",0,0]],"before":[{"para":307,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["9-10. Paṭhamahatthapādopamasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":334,"to":338,"paras":[{"para":334,"vripara":"236-237","refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["236-237. Navamaṃ “paññāyatī”ti vuccamāne bujjhanakānaṃ ajjhāsayavasena vuttanti āha –","<b>“dasame na hotīti vuccamāne”</b>tiādi.","Ettakameva hi dvinnaṃ suttānaṃ visesoti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"],["sn35.236:1"],["sn35.236:1"]]},{"para":335,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["Paṭhamahatthapādopamasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"]]},{"para":336,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["Samuddavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"]]},{"para":337,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["Āsīvisavaggo"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"]]},{"para":338,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.236:1"],"lines":["Āsīvisopamasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.236:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":332,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ādittapariyāyasuttavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":333,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["9-10. Paṭhamahatthapādopamasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
